---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="ChefYang privacy policy.">
  <div class="narrow">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 26, 2026</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>ChefYang has no accounts or sign-ups. We use privacy-friendly analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics) to count visits and see which pages people read. It does not use cookies or track you across sites.</p>
    <h2>Links and third parties</h2>
    <p>Amazon links are affiliate links. When you click one, Amazon may set cookies to credit the sale, under <a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GX7NJQ4ZB8MHFRNJ">Amazon's privacy notice</a>. Pinterest Save buttons open Pinterest, under Pinterest's own policy.</p>
    <h2>Ads</h2>
    <p>If we add ads later, the ad provider may use cookies to show and measure ads. This page will be updated and you'll be asked for consent where the law requires it.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: reach us on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/chefyang.fun/">Instagram</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
